      "en": "That day is a day of wrath, a day of distress and anguish, a day of trouble and ruin, a day of darkness and gloom, a day of clouds and blackness,",
      "ko": "그 날은 분노의 날이요 환난과 고통의 날이요 황무와 패괴의 날이요 캄캄하고 어두운 날이요 구름과 흑암의 날이요",
      "source_text_hash": "4d1b27485b9e17c88cd0246f7aff63c40badbac4391d385f2dae3840f307ee71",
      "translation_text_hash": "32ad3fa03ea3f7a4ee0e53ce79333db252ccb40026c6cc3c5d9bf2b5936ee499",
